<title>South Sudan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/south-sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-south-sudan-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;President Salva Kiir lifted the state of emergency in four states ahead of the 2027 elections while ethnic violence persisted, including gunmen opening fire on a Juba-Mundri vehicle that injured two passengers and fighting in Wau town. An aid worker was killed, a Christian woman was slain for refusing a forced marriage, and 26 people were killed in an attack on SSPDF barracks in Warrap state. Jonglei authorities handed over six more abductees to Pibor and a strike by truck drivers on the main highway was resolved after a deal with the government. The UN warned that hunger is worsening sharply because of conflict and El Niño, and there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trendsnafrica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5pNWRvaUNyVDdCQmVQZE5CWWc4d0lKbS12MmtkaGVrc2ZSNDFWY25FSjZtaTQxN2U2amtKZ0h1VUhBYlA5bWYyWkZranhEQndN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQeUlqcGI2RkxmUFBtOE9GNlBZYmtQdF9tMUtoWWE1S3JodFpOdHNIZHU3WlhfWlFaMVRJNmZjZlY3dDhWY25uZ0NSRXhmUVhScmptaVk1R3pVcmhhcmpuWW53OFhVa3JhTjc0THRsLXlpZFQ5RGdLSi1MeE5HRmhLc0VqUmVxMDVjOThwMWFKWXBjOUJvc1BXYzAxNnFEYkNCbURRcldn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPeExHSlFyZkVkaVItZVRMaW1nM2hHSkdvMUNjdV9yRUo0UHBFY01qNTRweGRuRVlEVjJ1bXd3ZWQ2ek05MmZhUjFaaFBoejVTc09XWWstSC1DQl9vRzdJRThFWjh4cTBhaXdMZkxtcl9LR0tqaTBIcDRmSW9JYmUxSXpsNENWbkFDM1IwbjBiWDBNYU9qMUMxNzJrSXpibU1SdjdSbUFVbmZoWEdKenQ1WWRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?